<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS TO SELL 300 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS TO SELL 300 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered to sell 150 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills and</p>
<p>150 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - Jan 22, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity of bills offered - April 23, 1997, July 23, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
